graph TD
    A[mRNA Processing Complete] --> B{Export Type?}
    B -->|Nuclear Export| C[NXF1/NXT1 Binding]
    B -->|Alternative Export| D[Alternative Export Factor]
    B -->|Quality Control| E[Export Quality Check]
    
    C --> F[mRNA-NXF1 Complex]
    F --> G[Nuclear Pore Complex]
    G --> H[Nuclear Export]
    H --> I[Cytoplasmic Release]
    I --> J[Export Complete]
    
    D --> K[Alternative Export Pathway]
    K --> L[Alternative Export]
    L --> J
    
    E --> M[Export Quality Control]
    M --> N{Quality Check Pass?}
    N -->|Yes| O[Export Proceed]
    N -->|No| P[Export Block]
    O --> J
    P --> Q[RNA Degradation]
    
    %% Regulation
    J --> R[Export Status]
    R --> S{Export Required?}
    S -->|Yes| T[Export Activation]
    S -->|No| U[Export Inhibition]
    
    %% Key proteins
    V[NXF1] --> C
    W[NXT1] --> C
    X[Nuclear Pore Complex] --> G
    Y[Export Factors] --> D
    Z[Quality Control Factors] --> E
    AA[Export Regulators] --> J
    
    %% Styling
    style A fill:#96ceb4
    style B fill:#45b7d1
    style C fill:#feca57
    style D fill:#feca57
    style E fill:#feca57
    style F fill:#45b7d1
    style G fill:#feca57
